Package: BiostatVD
Title: Biostatistics Validation Dashboard
Version: 0.1.0
Description: R Shiny application for automated validation of efficacy results
    in clinical trials. Supports IA boundary re-calculation, PFS efficacy
    validation via raw CRF/SDTM data paths, and ADaM dataset comparison.
Authors@R: person("BiostatVD", "Team", role = c("aut", "cre"))
